{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"@everyoneModerater Kiln made a good point. There has been so much amazing character flavor in the game, both posted publicly and sent to the DMs privately. This is a place for you talk about flavor decisions you have made. Both the things you have revealed, and goals.","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:21:28.694000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736679537961599009","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
