{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"1. *Shield* spell: A new modification on their chestpiece that forms an aegis-like barrier, shimmering slightly over their form.\n2. *Thunderwave* and *Expeditious Retreat* spells: A jetpack-like device that can create a sonic boom behind them, accelerating them incredibly quickly.\n3. *Eldritch cannon*: A small, elongated, rifle-shaped form with a long barrel for the ylkwa to be *catapulted* from, and a short barrel for the actual gun. The prong at the end with the yklwa also functions for their *shocking grasp*. It also has a scope on it, engineered from their love of Telescopes.\n4. *Faerie Fire* spell: Astella throws up a small bead-like sphere that projects and illuminates everything within the radius, lighting up hostiles in red.\n5. *Absorb Elements* and *Shocking Grasp* spells: Their \"arcane focus\" is a tinkered glove. They can absorb energy into it, and disperse it later with electrical bursts. \n6. *Alchemy Jug*: A wrist-mounted device that functions the same as an alchemy jug.\n7. *Mending* spell: A small, tinkered-together, dragonfly-like being that carries a small plasma torch and other tools needed to fix small things.","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:25:14.388000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736680484591108126","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"So to kick things off I'm going to explain how Kiln's spells manifest. I was inspired by <@566079740591603714> 's (see above) description of their gadgets and decided I needed to figure out how her spells do magic.\n\n\ntl;dr- GREEN FLAME\n\nDancing Lights/Light- Motes of Green Flames\n\nScared Flame- Pillar of Green Flame\n\nGreen-flame Blade- need I say more.\n\nSapping Sting/Toll the Dead- visible necrosis\n\nMage Armor/Lesser Resto/Protec G+E- Green Flames wisp around the target for duration. \n\nCure Wounds- above, but focused to injuries.\n\nGuiding Bolt- Big ass bolt of GREEN FLAME!","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:29:36.987000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736681586011013231","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
