{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"736679166262509618","content":"So with prosthetic limbs... My right arm has a normal setting to be an every day hand. The next setting is used for his basic attacks. A rod infused with \"enhanced spellcasting focus\" sits housed in his forearm, nevertheless, this setting looks like a small cannon. The third setting is his way of calling out his artillerist feature. The small cannon widens and the shots fired look like plasma balls (just looks). \n\nMage hand for him is a clockwork hummingbird\n\nHealing touch isnt a spell to him... But he'll gladly give you a shot of this substance with his brass syringe","created_at":"2020-07-25T20:34:49.328000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736682896063987802","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
